btle variations in footsteps, movement, and silence itself become your only tools. Identify what you heard. Retrieve the correct relics. Place them carefully. But be warned: mistakes won\u2019t go unnoticed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DON'T PEEK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/3a82796a2134232a41057fa0d4b607be.poster.avif?t=1744391446\" width=514 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/3a82796a2134232a41057fa0d4b607be.webm?t=1744391446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/3a82796a2134232a41057fa0d4b607be.mp4?t=1744391446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/044439b3acf869f1f16a468d27041f29.poster.avif?t=1744391446\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/044439b3acf869f1f16a468d27041f29.webm?t=1744391446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575190/extras/044439b3acf869f1f16a468d27041f29.mp4?t=1744391446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
